  "plain": "Dan Sherman is a former Air Force sergeant who says the NSA, the US agency that intercepts communications, once had him communicate with aliens. He tells podcast host Jesse Michels that in 2025 someone from the Disclosure Project, a group run by UFO activist Steven Greer that gathers witnesses, contacted him and offered him whistleblower immunity, meaning legal protection, if he would testify. Sherman says it was not Greer himself, though he thinks the two spoke a long time ago."
